diff --git a/debian/changelog b/debian/changelog
index 15aac0c..d6d4577 100644
--- a/debian/changelog
+++ b/debian/changelog
@@ -1,3 +1,14 @@
+gtk-nocsd (4.8+git20260924.6b1f70a-1+unity2~menu5) resolute; urgency=medium
+
+  * Experiment, second round: menu hooked from GTKNoCSDGetReferences, symbols
+    loaded lazily, menubar withdrawn when the shell stops showing it.
+  * Experiment: upstream main 6b1f70a (4.8 plus 20 commits) with
+    d/p/global-menu.patch, the global menu for GTK4 header bars written into
+    GTK-NoCSD.c in upstream's style, enabled by gtk-shell-shows-menubar.
+    Breaks libunity-gtk4-menu0, which would hook the same windows twice.
+
+ -- Ubuntu Unity Life Support <mihail.rozshko@gmail.com>  Fri, 25 Sep 2026 07:48:46 +0000
+
 gtk-nocsd (4.8-1+unity1) resolute; urgency=medium
 
   * Rebase on Debian 4.8-1 (the version in 26.10). Fixes Chromium-based
